WEBVTT

00:09:28.363 --> 00:09:31.955
because it's all of these
things that I love

00:09:31.979 --> 00:09:33.191
kind of in one place.

00:09:33.215 --> 00:09:35.902
And if you ever get bored,
you can look at another thing

00:09:35.926 --> 00:09:38.233
and do another thing
and talk about it, right?

00:09:38.698 --> 00:09:40.761
And so I had this TV show.

00:09:40.785 --> 00:09:43.786
And that was a very, very,
very big part of my process.

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:45.811
Actually, could you roll the clip, please?

00:09:45.835 --> 00:09:48.264
This is one of my favorite
clips of Rosie O'Donnell.

00:09:48.288 --> 00:09:50.836
(Video) Isaac Mizrahi:
We're back on the set. Hi, Ben!

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.198
Rosie O'Donnell: Hello, Ben.

00:09:52.222 --> 00:09:54.616
IM: Look how cute she looks
with just a slick back.

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:56.455
Ben: As my grandmother says, "Delish!"

00:09:56.479 --> 00:09:57.646
RO: Delish!

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:58.821
IM: Wow, delish.

00:09:58.845 --> 00:10:00.976
All right. So where
should I position myself?